// why: a binding read after a suspension is typed `typeof(match (s) { V(x): x, … })`, and when `s` was a hoisted local the copy narrowed it through a fresh local declared before a statement — inside a type there is none, so the subject had no type, the arm's variant was looked up by name in the file, and with two files exporting an `Opened` the module was declined
